---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import starship from '../assets/img/starship-pad.jpg';
import spacex from '../assets/img/logo-spacex.png';

const path = [
  { when: 'Now · Fall 2026', title: 'First year of mechanical engineering at BYU.', text: 'Joining the Rocketry Club propulsion team and applying to run the shop lab in the ME building. Taking the 200 N ethanol engine from CAD through assembly review. Flying to South Texas to watch a Starship launch from Starbase in person.' },
  { when: 'Winter 2027', title: 'Hotfire planning.', text: 'Test stand, instrumentation, and a safety review for the engine. Ride the carbon Manta bars. Get the electronic brake to a working prototype.' },
  { when: 'Spring 2027', title: 'First hotfire.', text: 'Light the engine, learn from what breaks, and cut the next revision.' },
  { when: 'Summer 2027', title: 'A summer in a build shop.', text: 'An internship in build engineering, structures, or propulsion. SpaceX first, then anyone else building flight hardware at rate.' },
];
---
<section class="section" id="ambition">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="h-section">Where I'm headed</h2>
      <p class="lede">I want to build the hardware that gets us off this planet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="engine">
      <div class="viewer-wrap">
        <div class="viewer" id="engine-viewer" data-model="/models/engine.glb">
          <canvas aria-label="Interactive 3D model of the liquid ethanol rocket engine"></canvas>
          <div class="hotspot-layer"></div>
          <p class="viewer-loading">Loading the engine model</p>
          <p class="viewer-hint">Drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, tap a label for details.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer-controls">
          <div class="modes" role="group" aria-label="View mode">
            <button type="button" data-mode="wireframe" aria-pressed="true">Wireframe</button>
            <button type="button" data-mode="solid" aria-pressed="false">Solid</button>
            <button type="button" data-mode="xray" aria-pressed="false">X-ray</button>
            <button type="button" data-mode="slice" aria-pressed="false">Slice</button>
          </div>
          <div class="actions">
            <button type="button" id="explode-btn" aria-pressed="false">Explode</button>
            <button type="button" id="reset-view-btn">Reset view</button>
            <a class="open-cad" href={site.links.onshape} rel="noopener">Open in Onshape</a>
          </div>
          <div class="slice" id="slice-controls" hidden>
            <label for="slice-slider">Slice height</label>
            <input type="range" id="slice-slider" min="0" max="100" value="50" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="part-panel" id="part-panel" hidden>
          <div>
            <p class="h-small" id="part-name"></p>
            <p class="quiet" id="part-desc"></p>
          </div>
          <button type="button" id="part-close" aria-label="Close part details">×</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="engine-text">
        <p class="engine-title display">Liquid ethanol rocket engine</p>
        <p class="quiet">In progress. This is the actual model, drag to turn it over.</p>
        <ul class="engine-parts">
          <li>Parametric thrust chamber with revision-controlled part names</li>
          <li>Injector body with an integrated torch igniter</li>
          <li>Separate LOX and ethanol feed adapters with finish-machined mating surfaces</li>
          <li>Service flanges and valve interfaces</li>
          <li>Gimbal cradle and ring stack for future thrust vector control</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="meta engine-process">Requirements, then parametric CAD, then assembly review, then hotfire planning.</p>
        <div class="prose engine-prose">
          <p>Before my mission I watched a Falcon 9 streak across the sky over Joshua Tree, and I've been chasing that feeling since. When I got home I went straight back to rockets, designed my first two liquid engines, and started this one.</p>
          <p>At BYU I'm joining the Rocketry Club to help build an engine better than anything I could make alone. What I love most is the seam between design and manufacturing, the part where a drawing has to survive contact with real tools, real materials, and real deadlines. Enlisted showed me that seam, and I want to spend my career on it.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="engine-links"><a href={site.links.enginePost} rel="noopener">Read about the build on LinkedIn</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="banner">
      <Image src={starship} alt="Starship on the pad at night, venting, seen from above with the tank farm glowing orange beside it" widths={[900, 1600]} sizes="100vw" format="webp" />
      <figcaption class="cap">Starship on the pad at Starbase. Photo: SpaceX.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="goal">
      <div class="goal-head">
        <p class="meta">The goal</p>
        <p class="display goal-title">Build engineer on Starship, at Starbase.</p>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>The job lives on the seam between design and manufacturing: making sure what the design team draws can be built at rate, and sending what the shop learns back upstream. Enlisted showed me that seam. Everything on this page is me working toward it.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="goal-link">
          <a href={site.links.jobPosting} rel="noopener">
            <Image src={spacex} alt="SpaceX" height={16} format="png" />
            <span>The posting: Build Engineer, Starship</span>
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="path">
        <p class="meta">The next twelve months</p>
        <ol class="path-list">
          {path.map((p) => (
            <li>
              <span class="path-when">{p.when}</span>
              <div>
                <p class="path-title">{p.title}</p>
                <p class="path-text">{p.text}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <p class="path-foot">Open to build engineering, structures, and propulsion internships. <a href={site.resumePath} download>Resume</a> · <a href={`mailto:${site.emails[0]}`}>{site.emails[0]}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="importmap" is:inline>
  {
    "imports": {
      "three": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js",
      "three/addons/": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/examples/jsm/"
    }
  }
</script>
<script type="module" src="/js/engine.js" is:inline></script>

<style>
  .engine { display: grid; gap: 2rem; margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .engine { grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 3.5rem; align-items: center; } }
  .viewer-wrap { position: relative; }
  .viewer {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background: radial-gradient(70% 70% at 50% 55%, var(--paper-2), transparent 72%);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    touch-action: none;
  }
  .viewer canvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; display: block; cursor: grab; }
  .viewer canvas:active { cursor: grabbing; }
  .hotspot-layer { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .hotspot-layer :global(.hotspot) {
    position: absolute; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    pointer-events: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;
    background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 0; cursor: pointer; transition: opacity 160ms ease;
  }
  .hotspot-layer :global(.hotspot .dot) {
    width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--tan); border: 2px solid var(--paper); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--tan-deep);
  }
  .hotspot-layer :global(.hotspot .tag) {
    font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 88%, transparent); padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .viewer-loading { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-content: center; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }
  .viewer-hint { position: absolute; left: 0.9rem; bottom: 0.7rem; margin: 0; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); pointer-events: none; }
  .viewer-controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem 1.25rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 0.9rem; }
  .modes, .actions { display: inline-flex; gap: 0.35rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .viewer-controls button, .open-cad {
    font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;
  }
  .viewer-controls button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--forest); border-color: var(--forest); color: var(--paper); }
  .viewer-controls button:hover, .open-cad:hover { border-color: var(--ink); }
  .open-cad { color: var(--forest); font-weight: 500; }
  .slice { flex-basis: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .slice input { flex: 1; max-width: 320px; accent-color: var(--forest); }
  .part-panel {
    position: absolute; left: 0.9rem; top: 0.9rem; max-width: 22rem;
    display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: start;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper) 94%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(30,36,31,0.12);
  }
  .part-panel .quiet { font-size: 0.92rem; margin-top: 0.2rem; }
  .part-panel button { border: 0; background: transparent; font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); padding: 0; }
  .engine-parts { margin: 1.25rem 0 0.75rem; display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; padding-left: 1.1rem; list-style: disc; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .engine-parts li::marker { color: var(--tan-deep); }
  .engine-process { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .engine-links { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .engine-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .engine-prose { margin-top: 1.25rem; }

  .banner { margin: 0 0 clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem); }
  .banner img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 21 / 9; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 45%; border-radius: var(--radius); }
  .banner figcaption { max-width: 60ch; margin-top: 0.8rem; }

  .goal { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .goal { grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: start; } }
  .goal-head .meta { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .goal-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .goal-link { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
  .goal-link a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
  .goal-link a:hover span { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.18em; }
  .goal-link img { height: 16px; width: auto; opacity: 0.85; }

  .path .meta { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .path-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .path-list li { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  @media (min-width: 700px) { .path-list li { grid-template-columns: 9.5rem 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; } }
  .path-when { font-weight: 600; color: var(--tan-deep); font-size: 0.95rem; padding-top: 0.15rem; }
  .path-title { font-weight: 600; }
  .path-text { color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 0.2rem; }
  .path-foot { margin-top: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .path-foot a { color: var(--forest); }
</style>
